# Dest EXEs

After every DiggingJim / DiggingJimBuilder rebuild, the EXEs must end up at:

- `D:\OneDrive\Desktop\games\Digjim\DiggingJim.exe`
- `D:\OneDrive\Desktop\games\Digjim\DiggingJimBuilder.exe`

CMake POST_BUILD already copies them there. If that copy fails because an EXE is running, close those processes and copy again. Also copy updated assets (`tiles.png`, `mini_tiles.png`, sounds) into dest `assets` when those files changed and dest has that folder.
